<title>USA: Rally's same-store sales off in 1997.</title>
<headline>Rally's same-store sales off in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rally's Hamburgers Inc on Thursday said that same-store sales at company owned units have remained negative to date in the 1997 fiscal year.</p>
<p>The company did not provide any sales figures.</p>
<p>The company said that there are currently 470 Rally's units in operation in 19 states.</p>
